<section class="tour-section faq-section">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="tour-faq">
    <details class="tour-faq-item" open>
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">How do I book and when do I pay?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Booking is fast and flexible via WhatsApp ({{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}). For private airport and hotel transfers, zero advance deposit is required — you pay your driver upon arrival. For maritime excursions (Safari Blue, Mnemba, Prison Island), a 20% advance deposit via secure DPO/Pesapal link is required to lock in boat captain, fuel, and seafood lunch, with the remaining 80% payable on tour day. Fly-in mainland safaris require a 30% advance deposit to lock domestic flight seats and TANAPA park permits.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">Are park, marine, and conservation fees included?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Yes! All official Zanzibar government conservation fees (Menai Bay Marine Reserve levy, Mnemba conservation fee, Jozani National Park ranger fee, museum entries where applicable) are included upfront in our quoted rates. You will never experience surprise cash demands at the boat, park gate, or museum.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">What is your cancellation and weather policy?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Free cancellation up to 24 hours before your tour with no charge. Within 24 hours, a modest vehicle mobilization fee ($20) applies for private transfers and land tours. For maritime excursions, cancellations within 24 hours forfeit the 20% deposit due to pre-booked captains and fresh seafood. Under our Captain's Weather Guarantee, if the Zanzibar Maritime Authority advises against safe sailing, you receive a 100% full refund or free priority reschedule. Fly-in safari cancellations follow domestic airline and TANAPA permit rules (85% refund 7+ days before, 50% refund 3–6 days before, non-refundable under 72 hours).
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">Is hotel pickup and drop-off included?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Yes. Private, air-conditioned vehicle transfers can be bundled door-to-door from any resort in Zanzibar — including Stone Town, Nungwi, Kendwa, Paje, Jambiani, Kiwengwa, and Matemwe. Your assigned driver coordinates directly with you on WhatsApp.
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="tour-faq-item">
      <summary class="tour-faq-summary">Do you offer multilingual drivers and tour guides?</summary>
      <div class="tour-faq-answer">
        Yes! All standard tours and transfers are conducted in fluent English and Swahili. For an additional fee, we offer certified multilingual Zanzibari tour guides and drivers fluent in Italian, German, French, and Polish upon advance request. Please indicate your preferred language when requesting your quote.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>